      "text": "The republics of a continent should form a federal union to resist domination by an outside great power.",
      "value": 2,
      "rationale": "Bilbao's 1856 appeal argues that disunity leaves the republics prey to US expansion and calls for a federal congress with joint action.",
      "sources": [
