    {
      "text": "Disputes between neighbouring states should be referred to a common international tribunal before any resort to war.",
      "value": 2,
      "rationale": "Bilbao's proposed congress would arbitrate and no republic could go to war with another without first referring the dispute, except against violent attack.",
      "sources": [
